Name: mutt
Description: Text-based email client supporting MIME, GPG, IMAP, and threading
Version: 2.2.13-1+deb13u1
Arch: x86_64
URL: https://www.mutt.org/
License: See /usr/share/doc/mutt/copyright
Maintainer: arkanaOS Team
Dependencies:
  gnutls-libs
  krb5-libs
  libgpgme11t64
  libgsasl18
  libidn2-libs
  libtokyocabinet9t64
  ncurses-libs
Provides: mutt=/usr/bin/mutt, mutt_dotlock=/usr/bin/mutt_dotlock, smime_keys=/usr/bin/smime_keys
